flowchart LR
    Need[Agent needs an action] --> Select[Select tool + inputs]
    Select --> Boundary{Tool boundary?}
    Boundary -->|Native| Native[Native tools]
    Boundary -->|Workspace utility| Utility[Workspace utility]
    Boundary -->|Opt-in collaboration| Agent[Scoped agent]
    Boundary -->|Planned adapter| Bedrock[Bedrock adapter]
    Native --> Result[Read the result]
    Utility --> Result
    Agent --> Result
    Bedrock --> Result
    Result --> Validate[Validate the actual outcome]
    Validate --> Need
